# Eval run artifacts. Every lane writes a JSON trace beside its Markdown
# report; the traces run to five and six figures, and a settled issue's verdict
# already lives in the report, in ethos.md, and in git history. The Markdown is
# the evidence — cite the command that regenerates the JSON (#346).
eval/current-version/results/*.json
# Two exceptions, both unregenerable rather than disposable: the v1-legacy
# fixture performance-report-self-test.mjs reads, and the #322 preregistration
# timing record, which also carries the SHA-256 of every raw artifact retired
# above.
!eval/current-version/results/current-agent-performance.json
!eval/current-version/results/issue-322-preregistered-provenance.json
